      "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p>\n<p>I’m migrating from Odoo to ERPNext and am having some trouble creating groups within a list. Rather than use the opportunity model built in, I’ve created my own as it’s very customised. In Odoo my pipeline list looks like this:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/6/36dd9c6b45e066bb9c4f3173a51ed89b58c23c59.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/36dd9c6b45e066bb9c4f3173a51ed89b58c23c59\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/6/36dd9c6b45e066bb9c4f3173a51ed89b58c23c59.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"7PmA8jjVLghzSbVXI1QmyGRgBMl\" width=\"585\" height=\"356\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">585×356 16 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I’m looking to achieve the same sort of grouping on ERPNext but I can’t find the option for it anywhere</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/f/2f3f52c8445c718486ef020b9c4c63c99b1c32ee.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/2f3f52c8445c718486ef020b9c4c63c99b1c32ee\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/f/2f3f52c8445c718486ef020b9c4c63c99b1c32ee_2_690x285.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"6JY6RVepedi6JmjAFapkJe4eCVU\" width=\"690\" height=\"285\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/f/2f3f52c8445c718486ef020b9c4c63c99b1c32ee_2_690x285.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/f/2f3f52c8445c718486ef020b9c4c63c99b1c32ee_2_1035x427.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/f/2f3f52c8445c718486ef020b9c4c63c99b1c32ee.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1C1C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1312×543 36 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Kanban view displays them correctly but I’m really looking for a list view there’s too many vertical columns. Can anyone point me in the right direction?</p>",
